jordan: Seeing duplicate POSTs from the sample app when flipping network during auth refresh. Pixel 6/7, Android 13/14.

jordan: AuthInterceptor is simple and blocking:
```
class AuthInterceptor: Interceptor {
  override fun intercept(chain: Interceptor.Chain): Response {
    val token = TokenProvider.getSyncToken()
    val req = chain.request().newBuilder().addHeader("Authorization", "Bearer $token").build()
    return chain.proceed(req)
  }
}
```

lee: Any minify/R8 in debug? We had a previous bug where minify changed coroutine bridge behavior and timing.

jordan: Yup accidentally shipping debug minify. Turning it off drops dupes to ~0.

pat: Short-term: disable minify on debug and add -keep for auth classes. Long-term: ensure single-flight token refresh and shared OkHttpClient, avoid reusing Request objects.

